{'symbol': 'WRK', 'date': '2022-02-09 16:30:00', 'title': 'WESTROCK ANNOUNCES BOB MCINTOSH, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GENERAL COUNSEL AND SECRETARY TO RETIRE; DENISE CADE TO BECOME GENERAL COUNSEL', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WESTROCK COMPANY (NYSE: WRK) TODAY ANNOUNCED ROBERT (BOB) B. MCINTOSH, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GENERAL COUNSEL AND SECRETARY, WILL RETIRE FROM THE COMPANY, EFFECTIVE MARCH 4, 2022. DENISE CADE WILL BE NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GENERAL COUNSEL AND SECRETARY UPON MCINTOSH'S RETIREMENT. DURING MCINTOSH'S 27-YEAR CAREER WITH ROCK-TENN AND THEN WESTROCK, HE HAS OVERSEEN THE COMPANY'S LEGAL STRATEGY AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE AS IT GREW FROM APPROXIMATELY $900 MILLION"}